TimeFlowExtrafieldsDisabled = This page is disabled: TimeEntry does not manage extra fields (isextrafieldmanaged is off), so any field defined here would never appear on a time entry and its value would never be saved.
TIMEFLOW_LATE_ALERT_ENABLED = Morning late-arrival alerts
TIMEFLOW_LATE_ALERT_ENABLED_TOOLTIP = Detects each morning the employees who started no timer before the cut-off time and warns the users who have the "Read all time entries" right (TimeFlow notification, and email according to their preference). Off by default. Needs the Scheduled jobs (cron) module active and running.
TIMEFLOW_LATE_THRESHOLD_TIME = Arrival threshold time
TIMEFLOW_LATE_THRESHOLD_TIME_TOOLTIP = Time (HH:MM, server time) before which a timer must have been started. Default 09:00.
TIMEFLOW_LATE_GRACE_MINUTES = Tolerance (minutes)
TIMEFLOW_LATE_GRACE_MINUTES_TOOLTIP = Minutes allowed after the threshold time before an employee is considered late. The cut-off is threshold + tolerance. Default 10.
TIMEFLOW_LATE_WORKDAYS = Days checked
TIMEFLOW_LATE_WORKDAYS_TOOLTIP = Days of the week on which the detection runs. No public-holiday calendar is known: a day on which nobody started a timer is treated as a non-working day.
TIMEFLOW_LATE_MAX_DELAY_HOURS = Maximum detection delay (hours)
TIMEFLOW_LATE_MAX_DELAY_HOURS_TOOLTIP = If the first run of the day happens more than this many hours after the cut-off (server down, cron not running), no alert is sent that day. Default 3.
TIMEFLOW_LATE_ACTIVE_WINDOW_DAYS = Recent activity window (days)
TIMEFLOW_LATE_ACTIVE_WINDOW_DAYS_TOOLTIP = Only active accounts that started at least one timer during this period are monitored (an old account that was never disabled is not "late" every morning). Default 30.
TimeFlowLateMailSubject = [TimeFlow] %s employee(s) late this morning (%s)
TimeFlowLateMailIntro = The following employees had not started any timer by %s on %s:
TimeFlowLateMailOpen = See today's presence in TimeFlow
TimeFlowLateMailFooter = You receive this email because you have the "Read all time entries" right in TimeFlow. You can stop receiving it from the notification bell in TimeFlow (the in-app notification stays on).
TimeFlowServerTimeInfo = Current server time: %s (timezone %s, UTC%s). The arrival threshold time is interpreted in this timezone, not in the timezone of whoever sets it.
TimeFlowServerTimeMismatch = Warning: this browser is not in the same timezone as the server. Check MAIN_SERVER_TZ or date.timezone (php.ini) before enabling the alerts.
TimeFlowLateOutDisabled = Late-arrival alerts are disabled (TIMEFLOW_LATE_ALERT_ENABLED): nothing was checked.
TimeFlowLateOutNotWorkday = __DAY__ is not a controlled day (controlled days: __WORKDAYS__).
TimeFlowLateOutTooEarly = Threshold not reached yet (threshold __THRESHOLD__ + grace __GRACE__ min = __CUTOFF__, server time __NOW__).
TimeFlowLateOutAlreadyProcessed = __DAY__ already processed with the cut-off __CUTOFF__ (status __STATUS__, server time __NOW__).
TimeFlowLateOutDelayExceeded = Maximum detection delay exceeded (cut-off __CUTOFF__ + __MAX__ h = __LIMIT__, server time __NOW__): no new check for __DAY__.
TimeFlowLateOutMissed = __DAY__: first run of the day more than __MAX__ h after the cut-off (__CUTOFF__ + __MAX__ h = __LIMIT__, server time __NOW__): no alert.
TimeFlowLateOutInProgress = __DAY__: already being processed by another run.
TimeFlowLateOutNoActivity = __DAY__: none of the __EXPECTED__ expected user(s) started a timer before __CUTOFF__: treated as a non-working day, no alert.
TimeFlowLateOutRetried = __ATTEMPTED__ pending email(s) retried, __SENT__ sent.
TimeFlowLateOutRecheck = Re-check (the day had been processed with the cut-off __PREVIOUS__).
TimeFlowLateOutDone = __DAY__: __CHECKED__ checked, __LATE__ late, __CREATED__ notification(s) created, __SENT__ email(s) sent
TimeFlowLateOutDoneUpdated = __UPDATED__ notification(s) updated
TimeFlowLateOutDoneSkipped = __SKIPPED__ email(s) skipped
TimeFlowLateOutDoneFailed = __FAILED__ email(s) failed
TimeFlowLateOutDoneTail = (cut-off __CUTOFF__ = threshold __THRESHOLD__ + grace __GRACE__ min, server time __NOW__).
TimeFlowLateMailIntroAdded = Additional employees who had not started any timer by %s on %s:
